// Neural-network policy override for high-intelligence monsters (intel ≥ 7).
//
// Runs AFTER aiChaseSystem in the 'ai' phase.
//
// Contract:
//   • If the entity already has CastSpellIntent (set by a whileLOS hook), skip it —
