README.md:472:For more on why this project rejects the modern web toolchain, read [The Modern Web is a UX Crime Scene](https://pjensen.substack.com/p/the-modern-web-is-a-ux-crime-scene).
README.md:474:JSHack shows what native browser tooling can do on its own — and what agentic AI development looks like when the codebase is simple enough for both humans and agents to reason about.
